    "name": "pairwise_preference_loss_sum_aggregation",
    "intuition": "This loss encourages the model to assign higher log probabilities to preferred samples by comparing pairwise differences in log probabilities weighted by preference signals, aggregating the losses by summation instead of averaging to emphasize total accumulated pair loss.",
